# Input
```css
a {
    font-family: "Lucida Grande", 'Arial', sans-serif, sans-serif;
}

a {
    font-family: 'Arial', "Lucida Grande", Arial, sans-serif;
}

a {
    fOnT-fAmIlY: "Lucida Grande", '  Lucida Grande ', sans-serif;
}

a {
    font-family: 'Times', Times
}

a {
    FONT: italic 300 16px/30px Arial, " Arial", serif;
}

b {
    font: normal 14px/32px -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif, sans-serif;
}

a {
    font-family: Arial, 'Lucida Grande', "Arial", 'Lucida Grande', Verdana;
}

a {
    font-family: Arial, 'Arial', "Arial", sans-serif;
}

a {
    font: 12px Arial, 'Arial', Times, "Times";
}

```

